// ============================================================================
// SAFETY EMAIL ALIAS REWRITER
// Never send emails to @example.com from users.csv!
// Rewrites every recipient to your verified Gmail +alias (e.g., patil.durvesh8668+one@gmail.com)
// ============================================================================
const baseEmail = 'patil.durvesh8668@gmail.com';
const [localPart, domainPart] = baseEmail.split('@');

const aliases = ['one', 'two', 'three', 'four', 'five'];

return $input.all().map((item, idx) => {
  const data = item.json;
  const tag = aliases[idx % aliases.length];
  const safeRecipient = `${localPart}+${tag}@${domainPart}`;

  return {
    json: {
      ...data,
      safe_recipient_email: safeRecipient,
      email_subject: `Pre-Approved Offer: ${data.product_name} (${data.interest_rate}% p.a.)`,
      email_html: `
        <div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px;">
          <h2 style="color: #0f172a; margin-top: 0;">Hi ${data.user_name}, You Are Pre-Qualified!</h2>
          <p style="color: #334155; line-height: 1.6;">
            Based on your profile (Credit Score: <strong>${data.credit_score}</strong>, Monthly Income: <strong>INR ${data.monthly_income}</strong>),
            you have been matched with the following personal loan product:
          </p>
          <div style="background: #f8fafc; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid #2563eb; margin: 16px 0;">
            <h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #1e40af;">${data.product_name} — ${data.provider_name}</h3>
            <p style="margin: 4px 0;"><strong>Interest Rate:</strong> ${data.interest_rate}% p.a.</p>
            <p style="margin: 4px 0;"><strong>Eligibility Score:</strong> ${data.match_score}/100</p>
            <p style="margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-style: italic; color: #475569;">"${data.ai_reasoning}"</p>
          </div>
          <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <a href="${data.source_url}" style="background: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px; display: inline-block;">View Official Loan Details</a>
          </p>
          <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin-top: 24px;" />
          <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8;">
            Original CSV Email: ${data.original_email} | Routed safely to verified alias: ${safeRecipient}
          </p>
        </div>
      `
    }
  };
});
